#
# synth_pod.ys — Yosys synthesis script for WaveTensor Pod on ECP5
#
# This is the Stage 1 (ULX3S / LFE5U-85F) FOSS synthesis flow. It reads
# the same Verilog sources as the Vivado flow, defines WT_VENDOR_LATTICE_YOSYS
# so that include/attributes.vh emits (* keep *) instead of Xilinx-style
# attributes, and produces a JSON netlist for nextpnr-ecp5.
#
# Invoke via: `make MOD=synth-pod-ecp5` or manually:
#     yosys -q -c synth/lattice/scripts/synth_pod.ys
#
# Expected output:
#     synth/lattice/reports/pod_<GEOM>_synth.json   (netlist for nextpnr)
#     synth/lattice/reports/pod_<GEOM>_synth.rpt    (utilization / stats)
#
# Geometry is passed via `-D` command-line defines to the Verilog reader.
# Default geometry (2x2 clusters x 2x2 PEs) is baked into the RTL parameters.

# --- Read sources with vendor macro defined ------------------------------
read_verilog -defer -sv \
    -DWT_VENDOR_LATTICE_YOSYS \
    -I include \
    Pod.v \
    Cluster.v \
    PE.v \
    ISA_Decoder.v \
    EHDecode.v \
    PE_Core.v

# --- Hierarchy + elaboration --------------------------------------------
hierarchy -check -top Pod

# --- Standard synthesis flow for ECP5 -----------------------------------
# synth_ecp5 handles opt / techmap / abc / mapping to ECP5 cell library.
# -json emits the netlist nextpnr-ecp5 consumes.
# NOTE: -abc9 flag removed — Yosys 0.64's bundled ABC does not recognize
#       'ecp5' technology target when invoked with -abc9, resulting in
#       "Unsupported technology: 'ecp5'" at ABC handoff. Standard synth_ecp5
#       without -abc9 uses the classic ABC pass which handles ECP5 correctly.
# TODO(Stage 1): confirm 2x2 x 2x2 geometry produces expected LUT count;
#                 compare against Vivado XCAU25P (62K LUT baseline).
synth_ecp5 -json synth/lattice/reports/pod_2x2_2x2_synth.json

# --- Emit stats report --------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: `stat -tech ecp5` fails on Yosys 0.64 (unknown tech name in stat).
#       Use plain `stat` which reports LUT4 / TRELLIS_FF / etc. by cell name.
tee -o synth/lattice/reports/pod_2x2_2x2_synth.rpt stat

# TODO(Stage 1 Board bring-up):
#   * verify TRNG ring oscillator rings survive synthesis (grep for HIU
#     signal names in the .json netlist — `ro_out_w`, `ro_lfsr_q` must appear)
#   * check DSP inference for MATMUL_UNIT — ECP5 has SLICE-based mult primitives,
#     not dedicated DSP48-style blocks. Expect different resource distribution
#     vs XCAU25P (140 DSP → 0 DSP + more LUTs).
#   * geometry sweep: manually re-parameterize Pod / Cluster generics
#     (currently CLUSTER_ROWS/COLS + PE_ROWS/COLS are hardcoded to 2,2 in
#     the RTL). Alternative: use `chparam` inside this script to override.
